OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Fin the Lothians dying out this evening
OL,7,Fwith some clear intervals tonight.
OL,8,FOver the Southwest and Borders, more
OL,9,Fin the way of cloud and some showers
OL,10,Fcontinuing especially along Solway
OL,11,FCoast, but here too dry by morning.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FA bright start on Wednesday
OL,14,Fbut some showers developing in the
OL,15,Fafternoon and evening, a few showers
OL,16,Fturning heavy, with some thunder
OL,17,Fpossible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
